<title>USA: Viragen to repurchase up to 2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Viragen to repurchase up to 2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viragen Inc said on Tuesday that it authorized the repurchase of up to two million  of its common shares on the open market.</p>
<p>Viragen is a biopharmaceutical company focusing on treatments of various viral diseases and immune disorders.</p>
</text>
